<title>USA: Wal-Mart Aug same-store sales rose 3.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Wal-Mart Aug same-store sales rose 3.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BENTONVILLE, Ark 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month	     $7,843     $7,042	+11.4	  +3.9</p>
<p>  Year-to-date$56,360    $50,537	+11.5    +3.9</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures in millions except percentage.</p>
<p>    Month is  August  weeks ended August 30    .</p>
<p>Full company name is Wal-Mart Stores Inc</p>
<p>Same store percentage figures include sales from Sam's Club.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
